cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "ViWELL: a Vietnamese-language benchmark for culturally masked distress in youth-AI conversations"
message: "Prototype, pre-validation. Not a validated instrument. Please cite the version tag."
type: dataset
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-21
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/REPLACE-ME/viwell-benchmark"
abstract: >-
  An open benchmark for evaluating how AI models respond to escalating psychological
  distress expressed indirectly in Vietnamese by users aged 16-22. Measures missed risk,
  overrefusal, missed cultural context and pathologising on a single instrument using
  matched benign controls. Scenarios are multi-turn conversation trajectories annotated
  per turn for clinical signal, and per scenario for concealment mechanism and
  academic-calendar context.
keywords:
  - AI safety
  - evaluation benchmark
  - Vietnamese
  - school psychology
  - cross-cultural measurement
  - multi-turn evaluation
